Lets try and create a minimal package group for board bringup. Lets
call this basic system necessary for board bringup as "bootstrap".

Signed-off-by: Nishanth Menon <nm@ti.com>
Signed-off-by: Ryan Eatmon <reatmon@ti.com>
Signed-off-by: Denys Dmytriyenko <denys@konsulko.com>
---
 .../packagegroup-arago-bootstrap.bb           | 53 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 53 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 meta-arago-distro/recipes-core/packagegroups/packageg=
roup-arago-bootstrap.bb

diff --git a/meta-arago-distro/recipes-core/packagegroups/packagegroup-ar=
ago-bootstrap.bb b/meta-arago-distro/recipes-core/packagegroups/packagegr=
oup-arago-bootstrap.bb
new file mode 100644
